<section class="two" id="how">
  <div>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:32px">Three<br>steps.</h2>
    <div class="step"><b>1</b><div><h3>Install</h3><p>Grab the APK from GitHub Releases, or add the repo to Obtainium for updates.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><b>2</b><div><h3>Deploy</h3><p>Choose Debian or Ubuntu, pick your tools, watch the setup progress.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><b>3</b><div><h3>Build</h3><p>Open terminals, or launch Code Server and code from the browser.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--paper)">
    <div class="term" style="width:100%"><span class="d"># build it from source</span><br><span class="g">$</span> git clone https://github.com/abrahdev/ProotCode.git<br><span class="g">$</span> cd ProotCode/mobile<br><span class="g">$</span> ./gradlew assembleDebug<br><br><span class="d"># → app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

